==Battleground==
*2 [[Boulder]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Wind]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Red Wind]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,400f</sup>.
**15 [[Log]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Boulder]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Boulder]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**10 [[Log]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Red Wind]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**2 [[Boulder]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall the opening Boulders with [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]], then spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] as soon as you have enough cash. Start building up other ranged attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]]. The peons will prevent any sort of frontline offense from even reaching Teacher Bun Bun, so Crazed Bahamut Cat and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] will be your primary method of attack outside of Uber Rares. Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] will be immensely useful as well.

